#. module: external_id_manager
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:external_id_manager.field_external_id_entry__record_status
msgid ""
"\"Broken\" means the external ID still exists but the record it points to "
"has been deleted, so env.ref() on it fails. \"Model not installed\" means "
"the model itself is gone from this database, so the reference cannot be "
"checked."
